{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线首先落在左上方第一块大号米白色文字，字号最大、对比强，位置靠上；随后容易被下方第二块同样醒目的大字吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他此刻不想考虑两个人未来会怎样，只想舒服地待在彼此亲近的状态里。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、放松、沉醉、享受亲近。\",\n  \"missed\": \"想告诉对方自己有多喜欢这种相处，也想确认对方是否有同样的感受，但不知道如何开口，念头最终淡去的犹豫。右上角的阶段提示也不容易第一眼获取。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块同样醒目的大号文字争夺主视线，第二块容易分走对第一块核心信息的注意力。\",\n    \"第一块句子较长，包含不考虑未来和享受当下亲近两个层次。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "329428fb-a07c-4c0a-b25e-2dfe5a4bea4b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T030123147536Z", "elapsed_seconds": 39.329, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:02:02.470278+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bdb4aaa7e57d7c8d32ca81a7234f5058efde54ea6d6f3d8c181c10ca8259cf98", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": 